{"id":"level-up-2026-10-04","name":"2026-10-04 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s801","en":"The company relies on a skilled workforce drawn from nearby towns.","zh":"公司依靠来自附近城镇的熟练劳动力。","note":"workforce · 受雇的或现有的工作人员总数； 劳动人口 · a skilled workforce","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s802","en":"The preliminary results suggest that the new design saves water.","zh":"初步结果表明，新设计能够节约用水。","note":"preliminary · 开端的，预备的，初步的 · preliminary results","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s803","en":"Limited storage space was the biggest obstacle to expanding the shop.","zh":"储存空间有限是商店扩张的最大障碍。","note":"obstacle · 障碍， 妨碍物， 干扰 · overcome an obstacle","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s804","en":"The coast's fickle weather makes outdoor events difficult to plan.","zh":"海岸天气多变，让户外活动难以规划。","note":"fickle · 易变的， 无常的 · fickle weather","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s805","en":"The delivery van arrived outside the bakery before sunrise.","zh":"送货车在日出前到达面包店外。","note":"van · 运货车 · a delivery van","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s806","en":"A worm wriggled through the damp soil beneath the leaves.","zh":"一条虫子在落叶下潮湿的土壤里蠕动。","note":"worm · 虫， 蠕虫； 蜗杆， 螺纹 · an earthworm","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s807","en":"The spinning fairground ride made me feel a little dizzy.","zh":"游乐场里旋转的设施让我感觉有点头晕。","note":"dizzy · 头晕目眩的， 眩晕的； 人头晕的 · feel dizzy","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s808","en":"The young pianist showed exceptional talent during her first public performance.","zh":"这位年轻钢琴家在首次公开演出中展现了非凡才华。","note":"exceptional · 例外的； 异常的 · exceptional talent","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s809","en":"Part-time students constitute nearly half of the class.","zh":"非全日制学生构成了班级将近一半的人数。","note":"constitute · 组成； 构成； 设立， 成立 · constitute a majority","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s810","en":"The essay questions the legitimacy of decisions made without consultation.","zh":"文章质疑了未经协商就作出的决定的正当性。","note":"legitimacy · 合法性； 正统性 · question legitimacy","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s811","en":"You can tick off each task as you finish it.","zh":"每完成一项任务，你就可以打勾标记。","note":"tick off · 列举；用记号标出 · tick off items","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s812","en":"The documentary shows how the birds choose a mate.","zh":"纪录片展示了这些鸟如何选择配偶。","note":"mate · 交配，配种；配偶； 伙伴； 大副 · choose a mate","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s813","en":"The results helped convince the team that revision was necessary.","zh":"结果帮助说服团队认识到，修改是必要的。","note":"convince · 确信； 说服 · convince someone that","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s814","en":"The trail follows a narrow gorge between steep rocky walls.","zh":"步道沿着两侧陡峭岩壁间的一条狭窄峡谷延伸。","note":"gorge · 狼吞虎咽， · a narrow gorge","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s815","en":"Registration for the workshop closes at noon on Friday.","zh":"工作坊报名将在周五中午截止。","note":"registration · 登记， 注册； 挂号； 登记或注册的项目 · online registration","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s816","en":"The experiment was designed to test a widely accepted theory.","zh":"该实验旨在检验一个被广泛接受的理论。","note":"theory · 理论， 原理； 学说； 意见， 看法 · test a theory","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s817","en":"The exhibition compares railway stations across Britain and continental Europe.","zh":"展览比较了英国与欧洲大陆各地的火车站。","note":"continental · 欧洲大陆的；大陆性的；欧洲大陆人 · continental Europe","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s818","en":"An internal review identified several problems with the booking process.","zh":"内部审查发现预订流程存在几个问题。","note":"internal · 内部的； 国内的 · an internal review","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s819","en":"The extension gives the library two additional study rooms.","zh":"扩建部分让图书馆多了两间自习室。","note":"extension · 伸展； 延长部分； 电话分机 · a building extension","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s820","en":"The discussion focused on gender equality in access to education.","zh":"讨论聚焦于受教育机会方面的性别平等。","note":"gender · 性别； 性 · gender equality","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s821","en":"The form requires your signature beneath the final paragraph.","zh":"表格要求你在最后一段下面签名。","note":"signature · 签名， 签字； 签署 · a handwritten signature","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s822","en":"The architect designed a courtyard that welcomes afternoon sunlight.","zh":"建筑师设计了一座能迎来午后阳光的庭院。","note":"architect · 建筑师， 设计师； 创造者 · a landscape architect","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s823","en":"The museum volunteer demonstrated an old wooden butter churn.","zh":"博物馆志愿者演示了一个旧式木制搅乳器。","note":"churn · 〔因紧张或惊慌而〕反胃；〔制造黄油的〕搅乳器 · a butter churn","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s824","en":"Regular reading provides a strong foundation for later academic work.","zh":"经常阅读为今后的学术学习奠定坚实基础。","note":"foundation · 基础； 地基； 创立 · a solid foundation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s825","en":"The course examines the history of astrology in medieval Europe.","zh":"这门课研究中世纪欧洲的占星术历史。","note":"astrology · 占星学； 占星术 · the history of astrology","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s826","en":"The study records seasonal variability in the lake's water level.","zh":"研究记录了湖泊水位的季节性变化。","note":"variability · 可变性， 易变性 · seasonal variability","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s827","en":"The castle exhibit describes the defences built against potential invaders.","zh":"城堡展览介绍了为抵御潜在入侵者修建的防御设施。","note":"invader · 入侵者 · repel an invader","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s828","en":"Use this tool to punch a hole through the cardboard.","zh":"用这个工具在纸板上打一个孔。","note":"punch · 穿孔，打孔；重击，猛击；猛击； 冲床， 穿孔机； 力量， 效力 · punch a hole","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s829","en":"The guide explained which plants occur naturally on the island.","zh":"向导解释了哪些植物是岛上天然生长的。","note":"naturally · 当然， 自然； 天生地 · occur naturally","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s830","en":"Online booking gives visitors greater flexibility when planning their trips.","zh":"在线预订让游客规划行程时更加灵活。","note":"flexibility · 柔韧， 有弹性； 柔顺， 温顺； 灵活性； 适应性 · greater flexibility","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s831","en":"Traditional festivals help the community maintain its shared identity.","zh":"传统节日帮助社区维持共同的身份认同。","note":"identity · 身份； 特性； 同一性 · a sense of identity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s832","en":"The textbook compares federal systems in several different countries.","zh":"教材比较了几个不同国家的联邦制度。","note":"federal · 联邦的， 联盟的 · a federal system","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s833","en":"Please verify the dates before adding them to the invitation.","zh":"把日期写上邀请函前，请核实一下。","note":"verify · 证明； 证实 · verify the details","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s834","en":"We booked an excursion to the old lighthouse on Sunday.","zh":"我们预订了周日前往老灯塔的短途游览。","note":"excursion · 远足， 短途旅游； 【物】 偏移， 漂移 · a day excursion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s835","en":"His snobbish remarks about local cafés annoyed his friends.","zh":"他对当地咖啡馆的势利评论让朋友们感到恼火。","note":"snobbish · 势利的， 谄上欺下的； 自命不凡的 · a snobbish attitude","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s836","en":"The university will inaugurate its new lecture series in October.","zh":"大学将在十月启动新的系列讲座。","note":"inaugurate · 开始， 开创； 为…举行就职典礼； 为…举行开幕式； 为…举行落成仪式 · inaugurate a programme","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s837","en":"The children earned a small reward for tidying the garden.","zh":"孩子们因整理花园获得了一点奖励。","note":"reward · 奖赏；报酬；酬谢； 奖励 · a small reward","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s838","en":"The room price does not include breakfast or parking.","zh":"房费不包含早餐或停车费。","note":"include · 包括， 包含； 计入 · include breakfast","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s839","en":"My sister plays hockey with her school team every Wednesday.","zh":"我妹妹每周三与校队一起打曲棍球。","note":"hockey · 曲棍球； 冰球 · play hockey","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s840","en":"A swallow built its nest beneath the old bridge.","zh":"一只燕子在老桥下筑起了巢。","note":"swallow · 吞咽；忍受；燕子 · a nesting swallow","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s841","en":"Free use of the studio is a perquisite of the job.","zh":"免费使用工作室是这份工作的一项额外福利。","note":"perquisite · 利益； 特权 · a job perquisite","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s842","en":"She spent a short stint working at a seaside café.","zh":"她在一家海边咖啡馆短暂工作过一段时间。","note":"stint · 定量； 限额 · a short stint","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s843","en":"The consolidation of three small archives simplified access for researchers.","zh":"三个小档案馆的合并简化了研究者的查阅工作。","note":"consolidation · 合并； 巩固 · the consolidation of","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s844","en":"The club aims to nurture talent through regular informal performances.","zh":"俱乐部旨在通过定期的非正式演出来培养人才。","note":"nurture · 培养；滋养；营养品 · nurture talent","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s845","en":"The destructive storm left several fishing boats badly damaged.","zh":"这场破坏力强的风暴使几艘渔船严重受损。","note":"destructive · 破坏的 · a destructive storm","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s846","en":"The survey mapped the village's remaining tillable land.","zh":"调查绘制了村庄剩余可耕地的分布图。","note":"tillable · 适宜耕种的， 可耕种的 · tillable land","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s847","en":"The friendly discussion began to degenerate into personal criticism.","zh":"友好的讨论开始恶化为人身指责。","note":"degenerate · 退化[dɪ'dʒ3nərət]；退化的 · degenerate into","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s848","en":"The belt's metal buckle caught the light as she moved.","zh":"她移动时，腰带上的金属扣反射出了光亮。","note":"buckle · 扣紧； 变形； 弯曲；皮带扣环 · a belt buckle","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s849","en":"We should examine the figures before making a hasty decision.","zh":"我们应该先审视数据，避免仓促决定。","note":"hasty · 草率的， 匆忙的 · a hasty decision","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:s850","en":"The exhibition shows how officials attempted to censor the newspaper.","zh":"展览展示了官员如何试图审查这份报纸。","note":"censor · 审查，检查；检查员 · censor a text","recordings":[]}],"words":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:w801","en":"workforce","zh":"受雇的或现有的工作人员总数； 劳动人口","note":"英 /'wɜːkfɔːs/ · 美 /'wɝkfɔrs/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0801-uk-1e42584b9fcb.mp3","text":"workforce"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0801-us-6f94e8db9e49.mp3","text":"workforce"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:w802","en":"preliminary","zh":"开端的，预备的，初步的","note":"英 /prɪ'lɪmɪnəri/ · 美 /prɪ'lɪmɪnɛri/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0802-uk-15076bfc6f68.mp3","text":"preliminary"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0802-us-b459d25b8d03.mp3","text":"preliminary"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-04:w803","en":"obstacle","zh":"障碍， 妨碍物， 干扰","note":"英 /'ɒbstəkl/ · 美 /'ɑbstəkl/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0803-uk-d2857676ba89.mp3","text":"obstacle"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/w